cff-version: 1.2.0
title: glucose-delay-simulation
message: >-
  If you use this repository, cite it as below. The repository is a scaffold
  and contains no results yet. It is not a medical device.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Eddie Andrés
    family-names: Ríos Elgueta
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9771-5787
    affiliation: Universidad Tecnológica Metropolitana
    alias: Stenon5
repository-code: https://github.com/Stenon5/glucose-delay-simulation
abstract: >-
  Specification, pre-specified criteria and test skeletons for a simulation
  study asking whether the blood to tissue glucose delay can be estimated from
  two sensing depths without any blood measurement, and what sensor noise
  level that would require. Synthetic data only, no device and no clinical
  validation.
keywords:
  - simulation
  - state estimation
  - kalman filter
  - replication
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
version: 0.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-22"
